nel_flicker.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/epic_tribe_panel_flicker.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-13i[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-13i/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Publish one aggregate roster per disk apply[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]atomic-roster-publication[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]atomic-roster-publication: merge the generation-stamped proc projection [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into the disk/cached roster before the single finalize, rebase if the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]generation moved during the worker, and cover the empty-disk plus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]live-projection regression.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Key AgentList widgets by tribe and stop blanking untouched [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]panels[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]tribe-stable-widgets[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tribe-stable-widgets: give each tribe a stable widget id, insert or [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]remove one panel without rebuilding siblings, skip clear_options on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unchanged row sets, and finish the standing-query row-remove path.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop incomplete bounded loads from replacing a larger cache[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]removal-authority[dim] · [dim][/dim]after atomic-roster-publication[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]removal-authority: patch same-query bounded loads regardless of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]has_more, keep a nonempty cache across a bounded zero, clear the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]complete-history latch only on a committed-query change, and converge [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]revalidate with auto-refresh.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove panel stability on the live host with traces[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]verify-on-athena[dim] · [dim][/dim]after atomic-roster-publication, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]tribe-stable-widgets, removal-authority[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify-on-athena: restart onto the landed tree, soak under by_status and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the standing NOT machine:apollo query, and assert from traces that @epic[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]never unmounts and one apply never publishes N then 0 then N.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-13i","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-13i.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-673d347488983db93d6444b1d2959ba6","started_at":"2026-09-19T15:06:50.058020+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"617bbedc67ffb6b4bed9b814c600bbede71b5f31480fd6600f07a6a6e8c0be28","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-13i.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"8ae9938f0a12a3fe9b44dacea4a42c799d993415eb4ffe7c48dfba42d8f2eb11","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-13i.4/meta.json","size_bytes":565},"prompt":{"digest":"0996749d598f382c055c52d8e62e168f7470adb097bb743f68a63a2dcab48ed4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-13i.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":208},"state":{"digest":"d0a0a96878a8d35d92e43d196a96deebaa7376b0fb9dfc2d89faeadaec4eedf8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-13i.4/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at"